  "Dots show potential movement with current blockers. It is not this side’s turn; checks and pins may restrict these moves. Rings show attacks or defended squares.": "圆点表示考虑当前阻挡后的潜在走法。现在不是该方回合，将军与牵制可能进一步限制走法；圆环表示攻击或保护。",
  "No friendly piece covers this piece’s square or can recapture a current legal capture.": "没有己方棋子覆盖这个格子，也无法在当前合法吃子后吃回。",
  "No opposing piece attacks this piece in the displayed position.": "当前显示的局面中，没有敌子攻击这枚棋子。",
  "Diagram coverage only: this board does not supply a full legal position and turn.": "这里只展示图示的控制范围，并非包含行棋方的完整合法局面。",
  "These are square-control relationships. Kings cannot be captured or recaptured.": "这里显示格子控制关系。王不能被吃，也不存在吃回王。",
  "Protection does not guarantee safety. Solid lines show coverage or an available recapture; dashed lines show restricted or conditional recaptures.": "有保护不代表一定安全。实线表示控制或可吃回，虚线表示受到限制或有条件的吃回。",
  "Captures are checked with the attacking side to move. Solid lines indicate a legal capture; dashed lines show geometric attacks restricted by king safety. This does not predict the opponent’s choice.": "假设攻击方行棋来检查吃子。实线表示合法吃子，虚线表示受王的安全限制的攻击；这不预测对手选择。",
  "Covers this square in the diagram. Legal captures cannot be established from this diagram alone.": "在图示中控制此格，但仅凭不完整图示不能确定吃子是否合法。",
  "Controls the king’s square. Kings are checked, never captured.": "控制王所在的格子。王会被将军，但不会被吃掉。",
  "Covers this square, but cannot legally capture this piece in this position. Capturing here would leave its own king in check.": "控制此格，但这里不能合法吃子，否则自己的王会被将军。",
  "Covers this square, but moving onto it would leave its own king in check. A future recapture depends on the capturing move.": "控制此格，但移动过去会让自己的王被将军。能否吃回要看对手具体走法。",
  "Covers this square. No opposing piece has a legal capture here in the current position; a future recapture depends on how the position changes.": "控制此格。当前没有敌子能合法吃这里，未来能否吃回取决于局面变化。",
